      "statement": "Pool implementations are selected by name from an ALIASES registry (prefork/processes, solo, threads, eventlet, gevent, and a custom pool from CELERY_CUSTOM_WORKER_POOL), resolved with symbol_by_name so any dotted path to a BasePool subclass can be used.",
