      "statement": "BasePool defines the pool contract: lifecycle states, apply_async delegating to on_apply with callbacks and timeouts, and capability flags (signal_safe, is_green, uses_semaphore, task_join_will_block, body_can_be_buffer) that other parts of the worker consult.",
