      "statement": "Prefork uses billiard; it chooses AsynPool when threads is false and billiard's blocking Pool otherwise, and each child runs process_initializer to set the parent-death signal, reset/ignore signals, set up the loader and logging, finalize the app and rebuild per-task tracers.",
